# The Gradle wrapper is committed deliberately: without gradlew and
# gradle-wrapper.jar a fresh clone cannot build. Regenerating the wrapper is
# possible but a needless step for anyone who just wants to run the app.
# (Flutter's template ignores these; that default is wrong for a shared repo.)

/.gradle
/captures/
/local.properties
GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

